{
  "name": "dsh-agent-team-auto-orchestrator",
  "version": "1.3.2",
  "description": "DSH 智能体团队编排器：宿主端每轮常驻注入「智能体团队编排方法论」（12 节）+ 工具层硬门（只认真派活、按 todo 自适应：标 【并行】（或 【并行×N】）须一次派满（路数可配 2~16），标 1 路照拒；todo ≤2 条且无「并行」免派），把「先判可逆性、能拆就并行、派活即契约、员工池复用」变成任何预设、任何会话的默认行为。三档（省 Token / 中规中矩 / 超级高效）通过本机回环 HTTP 路由切换，闸门参数立即生效、注入文本下一轮生效；宿主参数（maxMembers / maxActiveSubagents 等）只读展示，本插件不写。本机专属内容（预设路由表 / 业务域关键词 / profile 名 / 当前档位）外置到 <DSH_HOME>/team-orchestrator.local.json —— 发布包只含通用默认，结构上打不进任何本机信息。零遥测，仅本机回环状态路由与档位路由。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "sideEffects": false,
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1",
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "!lib/*.bak",
    "!lib/*.bak-*",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "docs",
    "docs/**/*",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "locale/*.json"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "prepublishOnly": "node scripts/scan-private.mjs",
    "test": "node test/gate-maxparallel.test.mjs"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-agent-team-auto-orchestrator.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-agent-team-auto-orchestrator#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-agent-team-auto-orchestrator/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "agent-team",
    "orchestrator",
    "parallel",
    "团队",
    "并行"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
